> choosed  us-west-1  have only two AZ
> public subnet  - if the subnets are routing the traffic through the route table to internet gateway 
> private subnet - if the subnets are routing the traffic through the route table to NAT gateway

OBJECTIVES
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Region     : us-west-1
VPC Range  : 172.20.0.0/16
4 Subnets  : 2 pub sub, 2 priv sub
2 zones    : us-west-1a, us-west-1b
172.20.1.0/24 => pub-sub-1 [us-west-1a]
172.20.2.0/24 => pub-sub-2 [us-west-1b]
172.20.3.0/24 => priv-sub-1 [us-west-1a]
172.20.4.0/24 => priv-sub-2 [us-west-1b]
1 Internet GW
2 NAT Gateway  > For hihg availability we need two,for cost optimization we crating only one
2 EIP          > ''
2 Route Tables : 1 Pub Sub RT, 1 Prix Sub RT
1 Bastion host in Pub subnet 

NACL
1 more VPC => VPC Peering
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

> your vpc create one
> create 4 subnets by selecting created vpc > 2 public diff AZ,2 private diff AZ
> create igw - action attach to vpc
> create public route tables > select vpc 
    > subnets association -edit -select 2 public subnets
    > edit routes - 0.0.0.0/0 to igw

# to assign auto public ip to every instance in public subnet 
 - subnets-select each public  subnets -edit subnet settings -auto assign ip

> create Elastic ip 
> craate natgateway($) - place NAT gateway in public subnet1 - allocate EIP
> create private route tables > select vpc 
    > subnets association -edit -select 2 private subnets
    > edit routes - 0.0.0.0/0 to NAT gateway

# to assign DNS hostnames for vpc 
  - select vpc- edit vpc settings - enable dns hostname

> TO CREATE A BOSTON HOST - it is the single point of entry in vpc to access the resourses in private subnet
> crete ec2 in public subnet of vpc - sg shh allowed from myip
> create a keypair [door] bastion-key
> select ami checked for vulnarabilities [cis]

# now creating instance in private subnet , ssh to this instance through baston host
> crete keypair [web-key] 
>$ scp -i /Downloads/bastion-key.pem Downloads/web-key.pem ubuntu@publicip_of_boston:/home/ubuntu/
> shh to boston to check $ ls /home/ubuntu
> crete ec2 - ubuntu -keypair[web-key] -private subnet -sg shh source:custom sg_of_bastion











